    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2615" root="بشع" body-key="b">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْشَعَنِى الطَّعَامُ</span></b>  <i>The food caused me to experience a straitened state,</i> or <i>choking, of the
fauces,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَمَلَنِى عَلَى البَشَعِ</span>,) <i>by reason of its
coarseness,</i> or <i>roughness.</i> (IAar.) [See 1.]

